   "textLength": 1082,
   "text": "While there isn’t a central infotainment display, there is a full screen for the front-seat passenger. Because the screen is heavily polarized (or otherwise filtered), though, I couldn’t ever see what my passengers were doing with it. They can interact with the native media apps, but they can’t project CarPlay onto this screen.\nPainted in lustrous Rosso Portofino paint that glittered in the August",
