   "text": "Starting at $393,350, a Purosangue is significantly less expensive than the EV Ferrari, although our test car’s $576,544 price tag gives you some idea of how quickly the options list can start to add up. It’s also a lot more than you would pay for similarly powerful SUVs from Ferrari’s traditional rivals, like the Aston Martin DBX or Lamborghini Urus, but that’s the way that Maranello likes it.",
